# App mode carries no document corpus on disk — upstream's per-task image serves the
# documents — so the only uncommitted files are the ones byte-identical across every
# task. They are single-sourced in harbor_adapters/drbench/templates/ and laid down by
# `python -m harbor_adapters.drbench.main --populate <dir>`.
#
# Only tests/case.json (this task's question, ground truth, and app access) is committed
# per task.
*/environment/main.Dockerfile
*/environment/extract_text.py
*/tests/test.sh
*/tests/judge.py
